      "id": "f176db6c-b71f-3ea8-8f22-e15b0f21eb35",
      "contentType": "STORY",
      "title": "Seasonal Tailwinds Are Aligning for 30 & 10-Year Treasuries – Here's the Setup",
      "description": "",
      "summary": "There's a historically bullish seasonal window for longer-dated interest rates from now through early August. Lower liquidity in summer often leads to a \"search for yield,\" big coupon reinvestment flows in June/July, and the classic \"Sell in May\" rotation into safer assets, which tends to support Treasuries. Add in softer summer economic data, and you've got a setup that has favored duration for years. Not guaranteed, but the pattern is lining up again.",
      "pubDate": "2026-05-11T20:32:58Z",
